{
  "$comment": "Section contract. content is a JSON Schema fragment; every $ref (#/definitions/...) resolves inside schema/pagespec.schema.json, where this exact fragment is embedded as definitions.content_content-faq (verify_all.py checks they are identical). maxWords = ceil(1.25 x real observed max), min observed+1; x-observedMaxWords records the real observed count.",
